      {/* 闂傚倸鍊搁崐鎼佸磹閹间礁纾瑰瀣捣閻棗銆掑锝呬壕濡ょ姷鍋為悧鐘汇€侀弴姘辩Т闂佹悶鍎崝宀勵敋闁秵鐓涘璺侯儏閻忊晜銇勯敂璇叉珝婵﹥妞藉畷顐﹀礋椤撴稒鐎遍梻浣告啞閿氶柕鍫㈩焾閻ｅ嘲鈻庨幘鏉戜汗缂傚倷鐒﹂…鍥矗閸℃せ鏀介柣鎰綑閻忥箓鏌ㄥ顓滀簻闊浄绲奸柇顖炴煛鐏炲墽銆掗柍褜鍓ㄧ紞鍡涘磻閹剧粯鍤€闁秆勵殕閻撴盯鎮橀悙闈涗壕缂佲偓閸愵亞纾肩紓浣诡焽濞插鈧娲栫紞濠囥€佸▎鎾村亗閹兼惌鍠楃紞鎾剁磽閸屾艾鈧悂宕愭搴㈠闁哄被鍎辩壕?- 濠电姷鏁告慨鐑藉极閸涘﹥鍙忛柣鎴濐潟閳ь剙鍊块幐濠冪珶閳哄绉€规洏鍔戝鍫曞箣濠靛牃鍋撻鐑嗘富闁靛牆鎳愮粻浼存煟濡も偓濡稓鍒掗崼銉ラ唶闁绘棁娅ｉ惁鍫ユ⒒閸屾氨澧涘〒姘殜瀹曟洝绠涘☉娆戝幗闂佸湱鍎ら崹瑙勭濞戙垺鐓忛柛銉戝喚浼冨Δ鐘靛仜椤戝寮幇鏉垮耿婵炲棗绉崑鎾寸節閸屻倖瀵岄梺闈涚墕缁绘顢樺ú顏呪拻闁告洦鍋勯顓炩攽閿涘嫭鏆€规洜鍠栭、娑橆潩椤掆偓缁侇噣姊绘笟鈧褔鈥﹂崼銉ョ？闁哄被鍎查崐鍫曟煙閸撗呭笡闁抽攱鍨归幉鎼佹偋閸繀鍒婂┑鈽嗗亝閸ㄧ敻鍩為幋锔绘晩闁兼亽鍎遍崬澶愭⒑缁洘娅囬柛瀣ㄥ€濋悰顔锯偓锝庡枟閺呮繈鏌嶈閸撶喖骞冨▎鎰瘈闁搞儯鍔庨崢鍓х磽娴ｅ壊鍎撴繛澶嬫礃缁傛帒鈽夐姀锛勫幐?*/}
      {showMaterialForm && (
        <div className="fixed inset-0 bg-black/50 flex items-start sm:items-center justify-center z-[120] p-2 overflow-y-auto">
          <form onSubmit={handleMaterialSubmit} className="modern-card w-full max-w-2xl max-h-[calc(100dvh-1rem)] sm:max-h-[95vh] overflow-hidden flex flex-col">
            <div className="p-4 border-b flex justify-between items-center sticky top-0 bg-white">
              <h3 className="text-lg font-bold text-gray-800">
                {editingMaterial ? '\u7f16\u8f91\u7269\u6599' : '\u65b0\u589e\u7269\u6599'}
              </h3>
              <button type="button" onClick={resetMaterialForm} className="text-gray-500 hover:text-gray-800 text-xl">
                {'\u00D7'}
              </button>
            </div>
            
            <div className="p-4 space-y-3">
              <div className="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-3">
                <div className="relative">
                  <label className="block text-gray-700 font-medium mb-1 text-xs">{'\u7269\u6599\u540d\u79f0'}*</label>
                  <input
                    className="modern-input w-full text-xs"
                    value={materialFormData.name}
                    onChange={e => handleMaterialFormNameChange(e.target.value)}
                    placeholder={'\u8bf7\u8f93\u5165\u7269\u6599\u540d\u79f0'}
                    required
                  />
                  {showMaterialFormSuggestions && materialSuggestions.length > 0 && (
                    <div className="absolute top-full left-0 right-0 mt-1 bg-white border border-gray-300 rounded-lg shadow-lg z-10 max-h-40 overflow-y-auto">
                      {materialSuggestions.map((material, index) => (
                        <div
                          key={index}
                          onClick={() => selectMaterialFormSuggestion(material)}
                          className="px-3 py-2 hover:bg-blue-50 cursor-pointer border-b last:border-b-0 text-xs"
                        >
                          <div className="font-medium text-gray-800">{material.name}</div>
                          <div className="text-gray-600 text-xs">
                            {material.specification && `\u89c4\u683c: ${material.specification}`}
                            {material.unit && ` | \u5355\u4f4d: ${material.unit}`}
                            {material.unitPrice && ` | \u5355\u4ef7: \u00A5${material.unitPrice}`}
                          </div>
                        </div>
                      ))}
                    </div>
                  )}
                </div>
                <div>
                  <label className="block text-gray-700 font-medium mb-1 text-xs">{'\u89c4\u683c\u578b\u53f7'}</label>
                  <input
                    className="modern-input w-full text-xs"
                    value={materialFormData.specification}
                    onChange={e => setMaterialFormData({...materialFormData, specification: e.target.value})}
                    placeholder={'\u8bf7\u8f93\u5165\u89c4\u683c\u578b\u53f7'}
                  />
                </div>
              </div>

              <div className="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-3">
                <div>
                  <label className="block text-gray-700 font-medium mb-1 text-xs">{'\u5355\u4f4d'}</label>
                  <input
                    className="modern-input w-full text-xs"
                    value={materialFormData.unit}
                    onChange={e => setMaterialFormData({...materialFormData, unit: e.target.value})}
                    placeholder={'\u4f8b\uff1a\u5428/\u7c73/\u4ef6'}
                  />
                </div>
                <div>
                  <label className="block text-gray-700 font-medium mb-1 text-xs">{'\u6570\u91cf'}</label>
                  <input
                    type="number"
                    step="0.01"
                    className="modern-input w-full text-xs"
                    value={materialFormData.quantity}
                    onChange={e => {
                      const q = e.target.value
                      const tp = q && materialFormData.unitPrice ? (Number(q) * Number(materialFormData.unitPrice)).toFixed(2) : ''
                      setMaterialFormData({...materialFormData, quantity: q, totalPrice: tp})
                    }}
                    placeholder="0"
                  />
                </div>
                <div>
                  <label className="block text-gray-700 font-medium mb-1 text-xs">{'\u5355\u4ef7'}({'\u5143'})</label>
                  <input
                    type="number"
                    step="0.01"
                    className="modern-input w-full text-xs"
                    value={materialFormData.unitPrice}
                    onChange={e => {
                      const p = e.target.value
                      const tp = materialFormData.quantity && p ? (Number(materialFormData.quantity) * Number(p)).toFixed(2) : ''
                      setMaterialFormData({...materialFormData, unitPrice: p, totalPrice: tp})
                    }}
                    placeholder="0.00"
                  />
                </div>
                <div>
                  <label className="block text-gray-700 font-medium mb-1 text-xs">{'\u603b\u4ef7'}({'\u5143'})</label>
                  <input
                    type="number"
                    step="0.01"
                    className="modern-input w-full text-xs bg-gray-100"
                    value={materialFormData.totalPrice}
                    readOnly
                    placeholder={'\u81ea\u52a8\u8ba1\u7b97'}
                  />
                </div>
              </div>

              <div className="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-3">
                <div>
                  <label className="block text-gray-700 font-medium mb-1 text-xs">{'\u4f9b\u5e94\u5546'}</label>
                  <select
                    className="modern-input w-full text-xs"
                    value={materialFormData.supplier}
                    onChange={e => setMaterialFormData({...materialFormData, supplier: e.target.value})}
                  >
                    <option value="">闂傚倸鍊搁崐宄懊归崶褏鏆﹂柛顭戝亝閸欏繘鏌℃径瀣婵炲樊浜滄儫闂佸疇妗ㄩ懗鍫曀囪閳规垿顢欐慨鎰捕闂佺顑嗛幑鍥蓟濞戙垹鐓橀柟顖嗗倸顥氭繝纰夌磿閸嬫垿宕愰弽褜鍟呭┑鐘宠壘绾惧鏌熼悙顒傛殬濞存粍绮撻弻銊╁籍閸ヮ煈妫勫銈冨劚椤戝寮诲鍫闂佸憡鎸诲畝绋跨暦椤愶絾鍎熼柕濞垮劤椤︻噣鎮楅獮鍨姎婵炲眰鍔庣划濠氬籍閸喓鍘介梺鍝勫€藉▔鏇炩枔鏉堛劋绻嗛柟缁樺笧婢ф稑菐閸パ嶈含妞ゃ垺绋戦…銊╁礃閵娿倗甯涢梻鍌欐缁鳖喚寰婃繝姘闁瑰瓨绻嶅?/option>
                    {materialSupplierOptions.map((supplierName) => (
                      <option key={supplierName} value={supplierName}>{supplierName}</option>
                    ))}
                  </select>
                </div>
                <div>
                  <label className="block text-gray-700 font-medium mb-1 text-xs">{'\u6750\u6599\u5206\u7c7b'}</label>
                  <select
                    className="modern-input w-full text-xs"
                    value={materialFormData.type}
                    onChange={e => setMaterialFormData({...materialFormData, type: e.target.value})}
                  >
                    <option value={MATERIAL_CATEGORY_MATERIAL}>{MATERIAL_CATEGORY_MATERIAL}</option>
                    <option value={MATERIAL_CATEGORY_CONSTRUCTION}>{MATERIAL_CATEGORY_CONSTRUCTION}</option>
                    <option value={MATERIAL_CATEGORY_COMMISSIONING}>{MATERIAL_CATEGORY_COMMISSIONING}</option>
                  </select>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div>
                <label className="block text-gray-700 font-medium mb-1 text-xs">{'\u5907\u6ce8'}</label>
                <textarea
                  className="modern-input w-full h-12 resize-none text-xs"
                  value={materialFormData.remarks}
                  onChange={e => setMaterialFormData({...materialFormData, remarks: e.target.value})}
                  placeholder={'\u8bf7\u8f93\u5165\u5907\u6ce8\u4fe1\u606f'}
                />
              </div>
            </div>

            <div className="p-3 border-t flex justify-end gap-2 sticky bottom-0 bg-white z-10">
              <button type="button" onClick={resetMaterialForm} className="px-3 py-1 text-gray-600 hover:text-gray-800 text-xs">
                {'\u53d6\u6d88'}
              </button>
              <button type="submit" className="modern-btn text-xs px-3 py-1">
                {editingMaterial ? '\u4fdd\u5b58' : '\u65b0\u589e'}
              </button>
            </div>
          </form>
        </div>
      )}

      {/* 闂傚倸鍊搁崐鎼佸磹閹间礁纾瑰瀣捣閻棗銆掑锝呬壕濡ょ姷鍋涢ˇ鐢稿极閹剧粯鍋愰柛鎰级閻ゅ嫬鈹戞幊閸娧呭緤娴犲鐤い鏍仜绾惧鎮楅敐搴℃灍闁绘挻娲熼弻宥夊煛娴ｅ憡娈堕梺瀹犳椤﹁京妲愰幒妤佸亹鐎规洖娲ら埛宀勬⒑閸濆嫮鐏遍柛鐘崇墵閻涱噣骞嬮敃鈧粻娑欍亜閹烘垵鈧摜鏁崸妤佲拻濞达絼璀﹂悞鐐亜閹存繃顥㈤柡浣稿暣婵偓闁靛牆鎳撻幗鏇㈡⒑閸濆嫭宸濋柛鐘虫尵缁粯銈ｉ崘鈺冨幈濡炪値鍘介崹鐢稿几濞戞ǚ鏀芥い鏂垮悑閹癸絿绱掓潏銊﹀鞍闁瑰嘲鎳橀獮鎾诲箳瀹ュ拋妫?- 濠电姷鏁告慨鐑藉极閸涘﹥鍙忛柣鎴濐潟閳ь剙鍊块幐濠冪珶閳哄绉€规洏鍔戝鍫曞箣濠靛牃鍋撻鐑嗘富闁靛牆鎳愮粻浼存煟濡も偓濡稓鍒掗崼銉ラ唶闁绘棁娅ｉ惁鍫ユ⒒閸屾氨澧涘〒姘殜瀹曟洝绠涘☉娆戝幗闂佸湱鍎ら崹瑙勭濞戙垺鐓忛柛銉戝喚浼冨Δ鐘靛仜椤戝寮幇鏉垮耿婵炲棗绉崑鎾寸節閸屻倖瀵岄梺闈涚墕缁绘顢樺ú顏呪拻闁告洦鍋勯顓炩攽閿涘嫭鏆€规洜鍠栭、娑橆潩椤掆偓缁侇噣姊绘笟鈧褔鈥﹂崼銉ョ？闁哄被鍎查崐鍫曟煙閸撗呭笡闁抽攱鍨归幉鎼佹偋閸繀鍒婂┑鈽嗗亝閸ㄧ敻鍩為幋锔绘晩闁兼亽鍎遍崬澶愭⒑缁洘娅囬柛瀣ㄥ€濋悰顔锯偓锝庡枟閺呮繈鏌嶈閸撶喖骞冨▎鎰瘈闁搞儯鍔庨崢鍓х磽娴ｅ壊鍎撴繛澶嬫礃缁傛帒鈽夐姀锛勫幐闂佺硶鍓濋悷銉╁煝閸喐鍙忓┑鐘插鐢盯鏌熷畡鐗堝殗闁诡喚鍏橀弻鍥晝閳ь剙鈻撳┑鍫㈢＝闁稿本鐟чˇ锔姐亜閹存繃顥㈢€规洖缍婂畷绋课旈埀顒傜不閺嶎偅鍠愰柡鍌濇硶閺嗭箓鏌曟繛鐐珦闁轰礁绉甸幈銊ヮ潨閸℃顫繛瀛樼矆閸楀啿顫忓ú顏呭仭闁哄瀵ч崐顖炴⒑娴兼瑧绉靛ù婊庝簻閻ｅ嘲鈹戦崱娆愭畷闂佸憡娲﹂崑鍡涱敊婢舵劖鈷戦柛鎾村絻娴滄繃绻涢崣澶涜€块柟顔欍倗鐤€闁圭虎鍨遍弬鈧梻浣虹帛閸旀瑥顭囪缁傚秹鎮欓鍌滎啎闂佸憡渚楅崢浠嬪闯閾忓湱纾肩紓浣诡焽濞插鈧娲忛崝鎴︺€佸▎鎾村亗閹兼番鍨洪崵鍫ユ⒒閸屾瑦绁版い鏇熺墵瀹曚即寮介銈囶槸婵犵數濮村ú銊ョ暤娓氣偓閺屾盯濡烽鐓庮潽濡炪們鍎遍悧濠勬崲濞戙垹绠ｉ柣鎴濇閸斿嘲顪冮妶鍡樷拹闁告梹鐟ラ～蹇曠磼濡顎撶紓浣圭☉椤戝懎鈻撻幇鐗堚拺闁告縿鍎辨牎闂佺粯顨堟繛鈧€殿喚绮换婵嬪炊閵婏附鐝抽梻浣告啞娓氭宕归崡鐐╂灁濡わ絽鍟埛鎴︽⒒閸喎鍠曠紒鎲嬬節閺屾稓浠﹂崜褉妲堟繝娈垮灟閸楀啿顫忕紒妯诲闁告稑锕ら弳鍫ユ⒑閸︻収鐒炬俊顐ｇ箓閻ｅ嘲顫滈埀顒勩€侀弮鍫濈妞ゅ繐妫Σ鎵磽閸屾艾鈧悂宕愰幖浣哥９闁归棿绀佺壕褰掓煟閹达絽袚闁稿﹤娼￠弻銊╁棘閸喒鎸冮梺娲诲幗閻熲晠寮婚悢鐓庣闁逛即娼у▓顓犵磼閻愵剙鍔ゆい顓犲厴瀵鎮㈤崗鐓庘偓閿嬨亜閹烘垵鈧鎮伴鈧铏圭磼濡儵鎷诲銈庡幖閻楀繐鈻庨姀銈嗗€风痪鐗埫禍楣冩煕韫囨搩妲稿ù婊堢畺濮婃椽鏌呴悙鑼跺濠⒀勬尦閺岀喖顢涘杈╁姱閻庤娲栧畷顒勫煡婢跺ň鏋庨柟瀛樼箓缁犲搫鈹戦悩鎰佸晱闁哥姵顨婇弫鍐煛閸涱厾顦梺鎸庢礀閸婃悂宕ヨぐ鎺撶厽闁哄啫娲﹂鐘电棯閹佸仮闁?*/}
      {showContractForm && (isProcurementManager || isCostManager) && activeTab === 'contracts' && (
        <div className="fixed inset-0 bg-black/50 flex items-start sm:items-center justify-center z-[120] p-2 overflow-y-auto">
          <form onSubmit={handleContractSubmit} className="modern-card w-full max-w-2xl max-h-[calc(100dvh-1rem)] sm:max-h-[95vh] overflow-hidden flex flex-col">
            <div className="p-4 border-b flex justify-between items-center sticky top-0 bg-white">
              <h3 className="text-lg font-bold text-gray-800">
                {editingContract ? '\u7f16\u8f91\u91c7\u8d2d\u5408\u540c' : '\u65b0\u5efa\u91c7\u8d2d\u5408\u540c'}
              </h3>
              <button type="button" onClick={resetContractForm} className="text-gray-500 hover:text-gray-800 text-xl">
                {'\u00D7'}
              </button>
            </div>
            
            <div className="p-4 space-y-3 pb-[calc(env(safe-area-inset-bottom)+88px)] sm:pb-4 flex-1 overflow-y-auto">
              <div className="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-3">
                <div>
                  <label className="block text-gray-700 font-medium mb-1 text-xs">{'\u5408\u540c\u540d\u79f0'} *</label>
                  <input
                    className="modern-input w-full text-xs"
                    value={contractFormData.contractName}
                    onChange={e => setContractFormData({...contractFormData, contractName: e.target.value})}
                    placeholder={'\u8bf7\u8f93\u5165\u5408\u540c\u540d\u79f0'}
                    required
                  />
                </div>
                <div>
                  <label className="block text-gray-700 font-medium mb-1 text-xs">{'\u5408\u540c\u7f16\u53f7'}</label>
                  <input
                    className="modern-input w-full text-xs bg-gray-100"
                    value={contractFormData.contractNo}
                    readOnly
                    placeholder={'\u81ea\u52a8\u751f\u6210'}
                  />
                  <p className="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1">{'\u81ea\u52a8\u7f16\u53f7\u683c\u5f0f'}: HN-CG-Year-Month-Day-Sequence</p>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div className="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-3">
                <div>
                  <label className="block text-gray-700 font-medium mb-1 text-xs">{'\u5173\u8054\u9879\u76ee'} *</label>
                  <select
                    className="modern-input w-full text-xs"
                    value={contractFormData.projectId || selectedProject?.id || ''}
                    onChange={e => setContractFormData({ ...contractFormData, projectId: e.target.value })}
                    required
                  >
                    <option value="">{'\u8bf7\u9009\u62e9\u5173\u8054\u9879\u76ee'}</option>
                    {projects.map(project => (
                      <option key={project.id} value={project.id}>
                        {project.name}{project.code ? ` (${project.code})` : ''}
                      </option>
                    ))}
                  </select>
                </div>
                <div>
                  <label className="block text-gray-700 font-medium mb-1 text-xs">{'\u7b7e\u8ba2\u65e5\u671f'}</label>
                  <input
                    type="date"
                    className="modern-input w-full text-xs"
                    value={contractFormData.signDate}
                    onChange={e => setContractFormData({ ...contractFormData, signDate: e.target.value })}
                  />
                  <p className="mt-1 text-[11px] text-gray-500">
                    {contractFormData.signDate
                      ? `${contractFormData.signDate.slice(0, 4)}\u5e74${contractFormData.signDate.slice(5, 7)}\u6708${contractFormData.signDate.slice(8, 10)}\u65e5`
                      : `??\u5e74??\u6708??\u65e5`}
                  </p>
                </div>
              </div>

              <hr className="border-gray-200" />
              <div className="relative">
                <label className="block text-gray-700 font-medium mb-1 text-xs">{'\u4f9b\u5e94\u5546\u540d\u79f0'} *</label>
                <input
                  className="modern-input w-full text-xs"
                  value={contractFormData.supplierName}
                  onChange={e => handleSupplierNameInput(e.target.value)}
                  onFocus={() => setShowSupplierNameSuggestions(true)}
                  onBlur={() => setTimeout(() => setShowSupplierNameSuggestions(false), 120)}
                  placeholder={'\u8f93\u5165\u4f9b\u5e94\u5546\u540d\u79f0\u53ef\u641c\u7d22\u81ea\u52a8\u5e26\u51fa\u4fe1\u606f'}
                  required
                />
                {showSupplierNameSuggestions && filteredSuppliers.length > 0 && (
                  <div className="absolute z-20 mt-1 w-full max-h-40 overflow-y-auto rounded border border-gray-200 bg-white shadow">
                    {filteredSuppliers.map((supplier) => (
                      <button
                        key={supplier.id || supplier.name}
                        type="button"
                        className="w-full px-2 py-1 text-left text-xs hover:bg-blue-50"
                        onMouseDown={(e) => e.preventDefault()}
                        onClick={() => applySupplierProfile(supplier)}
                      >
                        <div className="font-medium text-gray-800">{supplier.name}</div>
                        <div className="text-gray-500">{[supplier.contact, supplier.phone].filter(Boolean).join(' / ')}</div>
                      </button>
                    ))}
                  </div>
                )}
              </div>
              <div className="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-3">
                <div>
                  <label className="block text-gray-700 font-medium mb-1 text-xs">{'\u4f9b\u5e94\u5546\u5730\u5740'}</label>
                  <input
                    className="modern-input w-full text-xs"
                    value={contractFormData.supplierAddress}
                    onChange={e => setContractFormData({ ...contractFormData, supplierAddress: e.target.value })}
                    placeholder={'\u4f9b\u5e94\u5546\u5730\u5740'}
                  />
                </div>
                <div>
                  <label className="block text-gray-700 font-medium mb-1 text-xs">{'\u4f9b\u5e94\u5546\u8054\u7cfb\u4eba\uff08\u540e\u8ddf\u7535\u8bdd\uff09'}</label>
                  <input
                    className="modern-input w-full text-xs"
                    value={contractFormData.contactPerson}
                    onChange={e => setContractFormData({ ...contractFormData, contactPerson: e.target.value })}
                    placeholder={'\u5982\uff1a\u5f20\u4e09 13800000000'}
                  />
                </div>
              </div>
              <div className="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-3">
                <div>
                  <label className="block text-gray-700 font-medium mb-1 text-xs">{'\u5f00\u6237\u884c'}</label>
                  <input
                    className="modern-input w-full text-xs"
                    value={contractFormData.buyerBankName}
                    onChange={e => setContractFormData({ ...contractFormData, buyerBankName: e.target.value })}
                    placeholder={'\u5f00\u6237\u884c'}
                  />
                </div>
                <div>
                  <label className="block text-gray-700 font-medium mb-1 text-xs">{'\u94f6\u884c\u8d26\u53f7'}</label>
                  <input
                    className="modern-input w-full text-xs"
                    value={contractFormData.buyerBankAccount}
                    onChange={e => setContractFormData({ ...contractFormData, buyerBankAccount: e.target.value, bankAccount: e.target.value })}
                    placeholder={'\u94f6\u884c\u8d26\u53f7'}
                  />
                </div>
              </div>
              <div>
                <label className="block text-gray-700 font-medium mb-1 text-xs">{'\u4ed8\u6b3e\u65b9\u5f0f'}</label>
                <textarea
                  className="modern-input w-full h-12 resize-none text-xs"
                  value={contractFormData.paymentMethod}
                  onChange={e => setContractFormData({...contractFormData, paymentMethod: e.target.value})}
                  placeholder={'\u8bf7\u8f93\u5165\u4ed8\u6b3e\u65b9\u5f0f\uff0c\u5982\uff1a30%\u9884\u4ed8\uff0c60%\u5230\u8d27\uff0c10%\u9a8c\u6536'}
                />
              </div>
              <div className="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-3">
                <div>
                  <label className="block text-gray-700 font-medium mb-1 text-xs">{'\u5408\u540c\u91d1\u989d\u5927\u5199'}</label>
                  <input
                    className="modern-input w-full text-xs"
                    value={contractFormData.contractAmountUpper}
                    onChange={e => setContractFormData({ ...contractFormData, contractAmountUpper: e.target.value })}
                    placeholder={'\u5408\u540c\u91d1\u989d\u5927\u5199'}
                  />
                </div>
                <div>
                  <label className="block text-gray-700 font-medium mb-1 text-xs">{'\u4e0d\u542b\u7a0e\u91d1\u989d'}</label>
                  <input
                    type="number"
                    step="0.01"
                    className="modern-input w-full text-xs"
                    value={contractFormData.amountExclTax}
                    onChange={e => setContractFormData({ ...contractFormData, amountExclTax: e.target.value })}
                    placeholder={'\u4e0d\u542b\u7a0e\u91d1\u989d'}
                  />
                </div>
                <div>
                  <label className="block text-gray-700 font-medium mb-1 text-xs">{'\u7a0e\u989d'}</label>
                  <input
                    type="number"
                    step="0.01"
                    className="modern-input w-full text-xs"
                    value={contractFormData.taxAmount}
                    onChange={e => setContractFormData({ ...contractFormData, taxAmount: e.target.value })}
                    placeholder={'\u7a0e\u989d'}
                  />
                </div>
              </div>

              <hr className="border-gray-200" />
              <div className="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-3">
                <div>
                  <label className="block text-gray-700 font-medium mb-1 text-xs">{'\u6536\u8d27\u5730\u70b9'}</label>
                  <input
                    className="modern-input w-full text-xs"
                    value={contractFormData.deliveryLocation}
                    onChange={e => setContractFormData({ ...contractFormData, deliveryLocation: e.target.value })}
                    placeholder={'\u6536\u8d27\u5730\u70b9'}
                  />
                </div>
                <div>
                  <label className="block text-gray-700 font-medium mb-1 text-xs">{'\u6536\u7b7e\u4eba'}</label>
                  <input
                    className="modern-input w-full text-xs"
                    value={contractFormData.receiver}
                    onChange={e => setContractFormData({ ...contractFormData, receiver: e.target.value })}
                    placeholder={'\u6536\u7b7e\u4eba'}
                  />
                </div>
              </div>

              <div>
                <label className="block text-gray-700 font-medium mb-1 text-xs">{'\u4e0a\u4f20\u5408\u540c\u6587\u4ef6'}</label>
                <input
                  type="file"
                  className="modern-input w-full text-xs"
                  accept=".pdf,.doc,.docx,.xls,.xlsx,.jpg,.jpeg,.png"
                  onChange={e => {
                    const file = e.target.files?.[0]
                    if (file) {
                      setContractFormData({...contractFormData, contractFile: file, contractFileName: file.name})
                    }
                  }}
                />
                {contractFormData.contractFileName && (
                  <p className="text-xs text-green-600 mt-1">{'\u5df2\u9009\u62e9'}: {contractFormData.contractFileName}</p>
                )}
              </div>
            </div>

            <div className="p-3 border-t flex justify-end gap-2 sticky bottom-0 bg-white z-10">
              <button type="button" onClick={resetContractForm} className="px-3 py-1 text-gray-600 hover:text-gray-800 text-xs">
                {'\u53d6\u6d88'}
              </button>
              <button type="submit" className="modern-btn text-xs px-3 py-1">
                {editingContract ? '\u66f4\u65b0' : '\u4fdd\u5b58'}
              </button>
            </div>
          </form>
        </div>
      )}
    </div>
  )
}
